WEBVTT

00:10:32.844 --> 00:10:36.184
There will come a day
when I finally see my daughter,

00:10:36.208 --> 00:10:37.359
my little girl,

00:10:37.383 --> 00:10:38.533
again.

00:10:39.199 --> 00:10:40.592
And as she always did,

00:10:40.616 --> 00:10:43.519
she's going to make fun of me
for working so much.

00:10:44.157 --> 00:10:45.308
But she knew.

00:10:45.332 --> 00:10:49.115
She knew that she was the top priority --

00:10:49.139 --> 00:10:50.767
number one priority.

00:10:50.791 --> 00:10:55.863
And she will be thankful that work
helped Dad live a purposeful life

00:10:55.887 --> 00:10:57.475
after she was gone.

00:10:58.371 --> 00:11:00.075
It is such an incredible relief